{
  "_comment": "Build-phase static JIBAR 3M daily fixing seed \u2014 business days from 2026-01-02 through 2026-05-27. JIBAR 3M is the South African 3-month benchmark interbank rate, published daily by AFMA at 17:00 SAST. Rates are in decimal form (e.g. 0.0890 = 8.90%). Used by the build-phase JIBAR fixing ingester (platform/market-data/jibar-fixing-ingester.ts) to seed raw rate ticks into MarketDataStore for IRS pricing.",
  "_authority": "D-PRODUCT-CONSTRUCTION-SLICES-4-8 (CEO session-delegation 2026-05-26); D-MARKETS-SCHEMA-FOUNDATION (CEO-approved 2026-05-07); Team/Ravi.md (JIBAR conventions).",
  "_provenance": "Build-phase fixture variant. Production AFMA JIBAR ingestion (live AFMA feed) is sequenced post-licence. Ticks carry provenance=production in MarketDataStore (AFMA is a regulator-grade source) and fixingVariant=build-phase-fixture in payload.",
  "_rate_regime": "Jan 2026 - Mar 20 2026: SARB Repo 8.25%, JIBAR 3M approximately repo + 65bp (~8.90%). Mar 26 2026 onwards (MPC cut to 8.00%): JIBAR 3M transitions to ~8.65%. Small daily noise (2-4bp) within regime ranges.",
  "_exclusions": "Weekends excluded. SA public holidays excluded: 2026-03-21 (Human Rights Day), 2026-04-03 (Good Friday), 2026-04-06 (Family Day/Easter Monday), 2026-04-27 (Freedom Day), 2026-05-01 (Workers Day).",
